am</option><option value=\"WF\">Wallis &amp; Futuna</option><option value=\"YE\">Yemen</option><option value=\"ZM\">Zambia</option><option value=\"ZW\">Zimbabwe</option></select>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-end;\"><button type=\"submit\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #020617; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00fbff, #00cdfd); border: 0; padding: 15px 34px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\">Continue</button></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- STEP 2 -->\n      <div data-fake-form style=\"display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;\" data-on=\"submit:next\" data-bind-style=\"display:d2\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #00cdfd;\">Step 2 of 4</span>\n          <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 36px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: #f4fbff;\">Athlete Legal Bundle</h2>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9fb4c6;\">Version v2026.01.11. Please read the full documents before accepting.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 200px), 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n          <a href=\"/athlete-legal-bundle#athlete-agreement\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(4,28,48,0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\" class=\"hover-1rnkq\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #f4fbff;\">Athlete Agreement</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9fb4c6;\">Revenue share &amp; exclusivity</span></a>\n          <a href=\"/athlete-legal-bundle#athlete-terms-of-service\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(4,28,48,0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\" class=\"hover-1rnkq\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #f4fbff;\">Athlete Terms of Service</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9fb4c6;\">Platform use</span></a>\n          <a href=\"/athlete-legal-bundle#athlete-privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(4,28,48,0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\" class=\"hover-1rnkq\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #f4fbff;\">Athlete Privacy Policy</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9fb4c6;\">Athlete-specific data</span></a>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(4,28,48,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #c4d4e2;\">\n          <strong style=\"color: #f4fbff; font-weight: 600;\">Key points</strong>\n          <span>25% of net revenue, paid monthly with a sales report.</span>\n          <span>Exclusive worldwide right to make trading cards and digital collectibles featuring you.</span>\n          <span>12-month term, renews automatically. 30 days’ written notice to end it.</span>\n          <span>You keep ownership of your name, image and content.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label style=\"display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 12px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #eaf2f8; cursor: pointer;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required style=\"accent-color: #00cdfd; width: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 2px 0 0; flex: none;\">I agree to the Athlete Legal Bundle and confirm I have the rights to all photos and media I submit.</label>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 220px), 1fr)); gap: 18px;\">\n          <label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #9fb4c6;\">Type your full legal name to sign *<input required autocomplete=\"name\" style=\"height: 48px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); background: rgba(4,28,48,0.7); color: #eaf2f8; font-family: 'Work Sans'; font-size: 17px; font-style: italic; outline: none;\" class=\"focus-wp4ty\"></label>\n          <label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #9fb4c6;\">Date<input value=\"November 21, 2026\" readonly style=\"height: 48px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); background: rgba(4,28,48,0.35); color: #9fb4c6; font-family: 'Work Sans'; font-size: 15px; outline: none;\" data-bind-value=\"today\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8da2b5;\">We record the bundle version, date, time and IP address of your acceptance and email you a copy.</p>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #00fbff; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0,205,253,0.5); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\" data-on=\"click:back\">Back</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #020617; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00fbff, #00cdfd); border: 0; padding: 15px 34px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\">Accept &amp; continue</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- STEP 3 -->\n      <div data-fake-form style=\"display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;\" data-on=\"submit:next\" data-bind-style=\"display:d3\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #00cdfd;\">Step 3 of 4</span>\n          <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 36px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: #f4fbff;\">Payouts &amp; tax</h2>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9fb4c6;\">Payouts are handled by Stripe. Stripe collects your identity, bank details and tax form (W-9 or W-8) directly. Peace In Pressure never sees or stores your bank information. <a href=\"/athlete-tax-payouts\" target=\"_blank\">Tax &amp; Payout Overview</a></p>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"button\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 26px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(4,28,48,0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Work Sans';\" data-on=\"click:connectStripe\">\n          <span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #f4fbff;\">Set up payouts with Stripe</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #9fb4c6;\">Opens Stripe in a new window. Takes about 5 minutes.</span></span>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #00fbff;\"><span data-bind=\"stripeLabel\">Set up →</span></span>\n        </button>\n        <div data-if=\"payoutError\" style=\"display: contents\" hidden><span role=\"alert\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #ff7aa8;\">Set up payouts with Stripe to continue.</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #00fbff; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0,205,253,0.5); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\" data-on=\"click:back\">Back</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #020617; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00fbff, #00cdfd); border: 0; padding: 15px 34px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\">Continue</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- STEP 4 -->\n      <div data-fake-form style=\"display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;\" data-on=\"submit:finish\" data-bind-style=\"display:d4\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #00cdfd;\">Step 4 of 4</span>\n          <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 36px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: #f4fbff;\">Review</h2>\n        </div>\n        <ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n          \n            <li style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #eaf2f8;\"><span data-bind=\"review.label\" data-index=\"0\">Profile &amp; photos</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffc46b;\" data-bind-style=\"color:review.color\" data-index=\"0\"><span data-bind=\"review.status\" data-index=\"0\">Missing photos</span></span></li>\n          \n            <li style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #eaf2f8;\"><span data-bind=\"review.label\" data-index=\"1\">Athlete Legal Bundle v2026.01.11</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #00fbff;\" data-bind-style=\"color:review.color\" data-index=\"1\"><span data-bind=\"review.status\" data-index=\"1\">Signed</span></span></li>\n          \n            <li style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #eaf2f8;\"><span data-bind=\"review.label\" data-index=\"2\">Payouts &amp; tax form</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffc46b;\" data-bind-style=\"color:review.color\" data-index=\"2\"><span data-bind=\"review.status\" data-index=\"2\">Not set up</span></span></li>\n          \n        </ul>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #00fbff; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0,205,253,0.5); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\" data-on=\"click:back\">Back</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #020617; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00fbff, #00cdfd); border: 0; padding: 15px 34px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\">Submit</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- DONE -->\n      <div style=\"display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; align-items: start; padding: 44px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(4,28,48,0.75); border: 1px solid rgba(0,205,253,0.4);\" data-bind-style=\"display:d5\">\n        <span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #00cdfd;\">Onboarding complete</span>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 700; font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; line-height: 1; color: #f4fbff;\">You’re in.</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #c4d4e2;\">We’ve emailed you a copy of the signed Athlete Legal Bundle. We’ll be in touch when your card art is ready for review.</p>\n        <a href=\"/athlete-dashboard\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Yacote'; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: #020617; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00fbff, #00cdfd); padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 4px;\">Go to dashboard</a>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</div>",
